#: include/operator.php lib/ViewPage.php
msgid "Master"
msgstr "Meester"

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Compare loss and latency with the SmokePing graphs and maintenance state. Escalate missing files, imports and relinking to an administrator."
msgstr "Vergelyk verlies en latensie met die SmokePing-grafieke en onderhoudstatus. Eskaleer ontbrekende lêers, invoere en herkoppeling na 'n administrateur."

#: lib/ActionOutcome.php
#, php-format
msgid "skipped, %s"
msgstr "oorgeslaan, %s"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "XML"
msgstr "XML"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "YAML (default)"
msgstr "YAML (verstek)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "SmokePing-opstelling"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Jou toesteltoestemmings dek nie elke toestel nie, dus kan jy nie die SmokePing-opstelling uitvoer of invoer nie. Vra 'n administrateur met toegang tot alle toestelle."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Voer die SmokePing-opstelling uit"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Die uitvoer bevat die inpropinstellings, die SmokePing-teikens wat die inprop gelees het, en aan watter toestel elkeen gekoppel is volgens die toestel se gasheernaam en beskrywing. Dit bevat geen databron, grafiek, RRD-lêer of aanmeldbewys nie."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Laai af"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Voer 'n SmokePing-opstelling in"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Die keuse van 'n lêer kontroleer dit net. Die volgende skerm lys elke verandering wat die lêer sou maak, en niks word geskryf voordat jy daardie lys bevestig nie. 'n Invoer voeg by en werk by; dit skrap nooit 'n teiken of skuif 'n koppeling nie, en dit skep nooit 'n RRD-lêer of raak aan die SmokePing-datagids nie."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Kontroleer lêer"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Invoerkontrole"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Niks is geskryf nie."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Terug"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Die lêer kan nie ingevoer word voordat hierdie foute reggestel is nie. Niks is geskryf nie."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Die installasie stem reeds ooreen met die lêer. Daar is niks om in te voer nie."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Plan %s. Toepassing maak presies hierdie veranderinge in een transaksie. As die lêer of die installasie sedert hierdie kontrole verander het, word die invoer geweier en moet jy weer kontroleer."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Pas invoer toe"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Kanselleer"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Voeg SmokePing-teikens by"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "geen ooreenstemmende SmokePing-teiken nie"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Klik Gaan voort om die SmokePing-teikens by te voeg waarvan die gasheer die gasheernaam van elke geselekteerde toestel is. Elke teiken kry 'n opsommingsgrafiek vir waarskuwings en, wanneer SmokePing se data gekarteer kan word, 'n Smoke-grafiek. Toestelle word nooit hier geskep nie."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "%d teikens stem ooreen."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "%d objekte geskep of gekoppel, %d oorgeslaan."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Hierdie toestel het SmokePing-teikens, maar die leser wat hul opsommingswaardes invul, loop op poller %d en die toestel is op poller %d gestoor. Opsommingswaardes en waarskuwings stop totdat die toestel weer aan poller %d toegewys word."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "SmokePing-teikens van hierdie toestel"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "%d Smoke-grafieke teken steeds die ander kleure; die hoofpoller skuif tot 200 per siklus."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "%d Smoke-grafieke kon nie geskuif word nie; voer upgrade-graphs uit om hulle weer te probeer, en kyk in die Cacti-logboek vir die oorsaak."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Die Verlieskleure-instelling vra vir SmokePing %s-verlieskleure, maar die leser het SmokePing %s gevind. Stel dit op Outomaties tensy die grafieke van SmokePing s'n moet verskil."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Die Verlieskleure-instelling kies SmokePing %s-verlieskleure vir Smoke-grafieke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Die leser het geen SmokePing-weergawe gevind nie, dus kies die Verlieskleure-instelling die verlieskleure van SmokePing 2.8 en later. As SmokePing 2.7 is, stel Verlieskleure op SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Die leser het SmokePing %s gevind, dus kies die Verlieskleure-instelling sy verlieskleure."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Thold is nie geïnstalleer nie, dus waarsku geen teiken in sowel SmokePing as Thold nie."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Geen teiken het sowel 'n SmokePing-waarskuwing as 'n geaktiveerde Thold-drempel nie."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "%d teikens het sowel 'n SmokePing-waarskuwing as 'n geaktiveerde Thold-drempel, dus kan een probleem twee keer kennis gee. Vergelyk hul waarskuwingsvoorwaardes voordat jy een verwyder: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Die SmokePing-sjablone kon nie ingevoer word nie en word nie outomaties weer probeer nie: %s Gebruik Probeer sjablooninvoer weer nadat die oorsaak reggestel is."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Die SmokePing-sjablone is nie ingevoer nie. Gebruik Probeer sjablooninvoer weer."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Die SmokePing-sjablone is ingevoer."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Elke toestel met opsommingsdatabronne word deur die leser se poller gepol."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "%d toestelle het opsommingsdatabronne, maar word nie deur poller %d, wat die leser laat loop, gepol nie, dus het hul opsommingswaardes en waarskuwings geen data nie: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Die SmokePing-opstelling word op poller %d gelees, nie op hierdie bediener nie; die inventarisry wys die resultaat van sy laaste lees."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Die SmokePing-opstelling %s kan nie gelees word nie: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Die SmokePing-opstelling %s lys %d teikens; %d inskrywings is oorgeslaan: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Die SmokePing-opstelling %s lys %d teikens."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Die PHP-binêre-pad-instelling is leeg of nie 'n uitvoerbare lêer nie, dus kan die leser nie begin nie."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Die leser begin met %s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Die leser het nog nie 'n lopie op hierdie poller voltooi nie."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Die laaste leserlopie het %d sekondes gelede geëindig, meer as drie poller-intervalle."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Die leser het %d van %d reekse in %.1f sekondes gelees en het sy tydbegroting %d keer oorskry."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Die leser het %d van %d reekse in %.1f sekondes gelees, %d sekondes gelede."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Geen inventaris is op hierdie poller gelees nie."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Die laaste inventaris het %d sekondes gelede misluk en die vorige een word steeds gebruik: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Die inventaris het %d teikens %d sekondes gelede gelys."

