msgstr "Voer SmokePing-opstelling in"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Opstelling"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Die opgestelde SmokePing-lêer word gelees saam met die lêers wat dit insluit, vanuit sy eie gids. 'n Opgelaaide lêer word op sy eie gelees: @include word nie daarin toegelaat nie."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Die opgestelde lêer, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "'n Opgelaaide lêer, sonder @include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Opgelaaide lêer"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Slegs vir 'n opgelaaide lêer: 'n SmokePing-opstelling van hoogstens 4 MiB."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Toestelle"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Een toestel per SmokePing-gasheer groepeer teikens wat dieselfde gasheer peil. 'n Toestel wat reeds die gasheernaam op die gekose poller het, word in plaas van 'n nuwe een gebruik."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Een toestel per SmokePing-gasheer"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Een toestel per SmokePing-teiken"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Toestelsjabloon"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Die sjabloon van toestelle wat die invoer skep."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "Die poller van nuwe toestelle. Dit moet die poller wees wat die SmokePing-leser laat loop, anders kry hul opsommingsdatabronne geen data nie."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Werf"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
