msgstr "Die werf van nuwe toestelle."

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Geen"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Grafiekboom"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Spieël die SmokePing-hiërargie na 'n grafiekboom: elke afdeling word 'n tak, en elke toestel 'n gasheer onder die tak van sy teikens. Bestaande takke en gashere word hergebruik."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "'n Nuwe boom, hieronder genoem"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Moenie spieël nie"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Nuwe boomnaam"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Slegs vir 'n nuwe boom. 'n Boom wat reeds hierdie naam het, word gebruik."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Voorskou lees die opstelling en lys wat die invoer sou skep. Niks word geskryf voordat jy daardie lys op die volgende skerm bevestig nie, en SmokePing se eie lêers word nooit geskryf nie."

