#: lib/InventoryForms.php
#, php-format
msgid "SmokePing target %s (host %s) has no Cacti device. Choose what to do with it."
msgstr "SmokePing-teiken %s (gasheer %s) het geen Cacti-toestel nie. Kies wat om daarmee te doen."

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Create a new device from the SmokePing Target template"
msgstr "Skep 'n nuwe toestel vanaf die SmokePing-teiken-sjabloon"

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Map it to an existing device"
msgstr "Koppel dit aan 'n bestaande toestel"

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Either way the target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Cacti never writes SmokePing's files."
msgstr "Hoe dit ook al sy, die teiken kry 'n opsommingsgrafiek vir waarskuwings en, wanneer SmokePing se data gekarteer kan word, 'n Smoke-grafiek. Cacti skryf nooit SmokePing se lêers nie."

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Voeg by"

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Confirm Re-link"
msgstr "Bevestig herkoppeling"

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
#, php-format
msgid "SmokePing no longer lists %s. %s has the same host (%s) and probe (%s). SmokePing starts a new, empty file for a new path."
msgstr "SmokePing lys nie meer %s nie. %s het dieselfde gasheer (%s) en sonde (%s). SmokePing begin 'n nuwe, leë lêer vir 'n nuwe pad."

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Re-linking moves the smoke graph and the summary data source to the new target and the device mapping with them. The old file keeps its history in an archived graph. Nothing is deleted."
msgstr "Herkoppeling skuif die Smoke-grafiek en die opsommingsdatabron na die nuwe teiken en die toestelkoppeling saam met hulle. Die ou lêer behou sy geskiedenis in 'n geargiveerde grafiek. Niks word geskrap nie."

