#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Source"
msgstr "SmokePing-bron"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "SmokePing-poller"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Die Cacti-poller wat op die SmokePing-gasheer loop, of 'n lêerstelsel daarmee deel. Slegs hierdie poller lees SmokePing-data."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "SmokePing-opstellingslêer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Die hoof-SmokePing-opstellingslêer wat gelees word deur die poller wat die leser uitvoer. Die inprop lees dit en die ingeslote lêers met sy eie ontleder en skryf nooit daaraan nie. Ingeslote lêers moet binne hierdie lêer se gids bly."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "SmokePing-datagids"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Die datadir uit SmokePing se opstelling, soos SmokePing dit sien."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Cacti-montering van die datagids"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "'n Leesalleen-bind- of NFS-montering van die SmokePing-datagids binne die Cacti-RRA-pad. Cacti lees slegs RRD-lêers binne sy RRA-pad en nooit deur 'n simboliese skakel nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Leser"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Lesertydbegroting"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een leserlopie aan die lees van RRD-lêers mag bestee voordat dit stop en op die volgende pollersiklus hervat."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Inventarisinterval"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Minimum sekondes tussen inventarislopies. Die inventaris loop ook wanneer die opstellingslêer verander."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Varsheidstoelaag"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Sekondes ná een stap waarvoor 'n meting steeds as aktueel tel."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Verlieskleure"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Watter SmokePing-verlieskleure die rookgrafieke teken. SmokePing 2.7 teken ander verliesvlakke as 2.8 en later. Outomaties volg die SmokePing-weergawe wat die leser langs SmokePing vind, soos op die gesondheidsbladsy gewys, en gebruik 2.8 en later wanneer dit geen vind nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Outomaties"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.8 and later"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.8 en later"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.7"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.7"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deïnstalleer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Behou inproptabelle by deïnstallasie"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, behou die deïnstallering van die inprop sy inventaris-, karterings- en gesondheidstabelle. SmokePing-lêers word in elk geval nooit verwyder nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Backup Directory"
msgstr "Rugsteungids"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Waar die deïnstallering sy uitvoer van die inprop-opstelling skryf. Laat leeg om die cache/smokeping-gids van Cacti te gebruik, wat die inprop met 'n deny-all-reël beskerm. 'n Gids wat hier gestel word moet reeds bestaan, skryfbaar wees en buite die webwortel wees; wanneer dit nie skryfbaar is nie, word geen uitvoer geskryf nie."

